## 8. Entry, exit, and suspension criteria

### 8.1 Entry criteria

- Dependencies installed (`npm ci` or `npm install`)
- No unresolved compile errors in changed paths
- For E2E: Playwright browsers installed and port 5173 available (or web server managed)

### 8.2 Exit criteria (current frontend gate)

| Gate | Criterion |
| --- | --- |
| Lint | `npm run lint` exits 0 |
| Typecheck | `npm run typecheck` exits 0 |
| Automated tests | `npm run test:run` exits 0 |
| Coverage | `npm run test:coverage` meets at least 70% lines and functions on `test.coverage.include` |
| E2E | `npm run e2e` exits 0 on all configured projects |

### 8.3 Suspension and waiver

- A backend outage does not suspend unit or component suites (MSW isolation).
- E2E may be waived for documentation-only changes with an explicit reviewer note.
- Coverage threshold failures inside included modules are not waived unless the PR adds tests or justifies the change to the include list.

