## 11. Risk register

| ID | Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| R1 | Low page-level coverage allows CRUD regressions | High | High | Expand RTL tests per feature using the `FEATURE_PROMPT` checklist |
| R2 | Sign-in E2E coverage may be incomplete or fail if the new journeys are not verified in CI | Medium | High | Sign-in success, wrong-password, non-admin, and unauthenticated-redirect journeys have been added; record and verify their execution results in CI (P0) |
| R3 | A 403 response clears the session in the Axios interceptor, contradicting the architecture doc | Medium | High | Decide the intended behavior (only 401 clears the session), then encode it as an expected-failing test until the product is fixed |
| R4 | Coverage include list stagnates | Medium | Medium | Require include-list expansion when new shared modules are merged |
| R5 | Axe smoke mistaken for WCAG certification | Low | Medium | Documented as smoke only (§3, §5, §16) |
| R6 | Realtime (Echo/Pusher) untested | Medium | Medium | Keep isolated; add listener unit tests with a mocked Echo when needed |
| R7 | Colour contrast and layout-dependent a11y rules cannot be evaluated in jsdom | Medium | Medium | Run axe inside Playwright on login and shell pages, including RTL |

